   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "runs": [
     {
      "text": "١. نظرة عامة على المشروع",
      "bold": true,
      "fontSizePt": 13,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#B87F1E",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     }
    ],
    "direction": "rtl",
    "fontSizePt": 10.5,
    "align": "left",
    "spaceAfterPt": 10,
    "borders": {
     "bottom": {
      "color": "#D8D3C9",
      "widthPt": 0.75,
      "spacePt": 6,
      "style": "solid"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "runs": [
     {
      "text": "Sawt al-Nahr follows three families whose livelihoods depend on the Nile between Aswan and Rosetta. Episodes 04–06 move the series from portraiture into argument: each cut should carry one clear question and answer it with images before anyone speaks. The offline edit is built in Premiere Pro; the conform, grade and deliverables happen in DaVinci Resolve.",
      "fontSizePt": 10.5,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     }
    ],
    "direction": "ltr",
    "fontSizePt": 10.5,
    "align": "justify",
    "lineSpacing": 1.25,
    "spaceAfterPt": 6
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "runs": [
     {
      "text": "تتابع سلسلة «صوت النهر» ثلاث عائلات ترتبط معيشتها بالنيل بين أسوان ورشيد. تنتقل الحلقات من الرابعة إلى السادسة من التصوير الشخصي إلى الطرح والتحليل، بحيث تحمل كل حلقة سؤالًا واضحًا وتجيب عنه بالصورة قبل الكلام. يجري المونتاج الأولي على برنامج ",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": "بريمير",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": " ",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": "برو",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": "، بينما تتم عمليات التجميع النهائي وتصحيح الألوان والتسليم على دافينشي ",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": "ريزولف",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     },
     {
      "text": ".",
      "fontSizePt": 11,
      "language": "ar-SA",
      "color": "#1B2029",
      "latinTypeface": "Arial",
      "complexScriptTypeface": "Arial",
      "fontFamily": "Arial"
     }
    ],
    "direction": "rtl",
